<h2>How to contact us</h2>
<p>Monday to Friday, excluding bank holidays.</p>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">How</th><th scope="col">When</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{%- for a in site.access %}
<tr><th scope="row">{{ a.mode }}</th><td>{{ a.hours }}. {{ a.detail }} <a href="{{ a.link }}">{{ a.linkText }}</a></td></tr>
{%- endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Whichever way you contact us, we will respond the same day if your need is urgent, and by the end of the next working day if it is not.</p>

<h2>Building opening times</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead><tr><th scope="col">Day</th><th scope="col">Open</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{%- for d in site.building %}
<tr><th scope="row">{{ d.day }}</th><td>{{ d.hours }}</td></tr>
{%- endfor %}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Before 8.00am the building is open for booked early appointments only. For staff security, the front door closes at 6.00pm unless you have told us you are coming.</p>

<h2>When we are closed</h2>
<p>See <a href="/out-of-hours/">when we are closed</a> for how to get help in the evening, at night and at weekends.</p>
